#: scenario8:scenario8_47057BF5_44DC_41D6_8017_7B2CAE4C05CE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 119b11c064f453b83cff30df49e5187fd136fde4439d1e5f43ef29f82205a296
#. default-sha256: 3070acdbe7a13cb447440718d4acd8edad3b3700db7daed800860ed71ae893e8
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_47057BF5_44DC_41D6_8017_7B2CAE4C05CE"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I didn’t work on some nobleman’s estate,⟪k:1⟫but instead, I did physical labor—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫"
"construction work.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫I built roads and buildings, tore down hills and mountains."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Je ne travaillais pas dans la demeure d’un noble,⟪k:1⟫non, mon labeur était physique —⟪k:2⟫"
"⟪k:3⟫ j’étais sur les chantiers.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Je construisais des routes, des bâtiments, je creusais "
"des collines, des montagnes."

#: scenario8:scenario8_45FD88B4_AA76_42DE_94CD_DE73FCD1A352
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 13f0a8c43fcb10db60df81840d02a37bd7d14edd348c76b9a9fd5647a173ace3
#. default-sha256: eb95196135f7851350629f0908ac4d1794ae4e0a84b1b3f98f638c64232e38d7
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_45FD88B4_AA76_42DE_94CD_DE73FCD1A352"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And while I doubt I need to tell you this, living conditions were miserable. ⟪k:1⟫Other "
"slaves withered away and died on a daily basis."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Et je ne pense pas qu’il soit nécessaire de vous le dire, mais les conditions de vie étaient "
"déplorables. ⟪k:1⟫Les autres esclaves faiblissaient à vue d’œil et mouraient quotidiennement."

#: scenario8:scenario8_12FF52C4_7EBC_4641_BDF4_64368F767F58
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 70681c0eeaaa27208bd9655ab12cc0d446ce3fd7d7d4bf853c982cddf6539ddb
#. default-sha256: 28f6c5143270b6e910a6444318e694bd2e3c048b34bfb3b41abb559cdc3b958b
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_12FF52C4_7EBC_4641_BDF4_64368F767F58"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Working a noble’s estate would have been easier, without a doubt,⟪k:1⟫if only for the fact I "
"would have a specific master."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Si j’avais travaillé chez un noble, ça aurait été plus facile, sans nul doute, si on laisse "
"de côté le fait que j’aurais eu un maître spécifique."

#: scenario8:scenario8_534C0ED0_582D_42BB_B166_3AFB1F40CF0E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e6ba8bd990ea1724e1910838201056c6c5d07eed108a62c90a150019e7286082
#. default-sha256: 7dab4d36dbbe1b576293c7b39e156fe04b1217be7040a94074c4a52bf3ae2429
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_534C0ED0_582D_42BB_B166_3AFB1F40CF0E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I don’t remember anything about my life before becoming a slave.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫All I have are "
"those few images, from which I can guess I was part of a caravan,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Je ne me souviens absolument pas de ma vie avant d’avoir été réduit en esclavage.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫"
"Il ne me reste qu’une poignée d’images, et d’après celles-ci je suppose que je faisais partie "
"d’une caravane,"

#: scenario8:scenario8_63BF9B0D_C271_4399_B567_890C007FD834
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 43af9d589fd60298782a0b032bbdff16291a7eaf54cde98e32658e6ec440370b
#. default-sha256: e85b25eafb3737395f676f366066bfed5527cfa4eb81032821a75f8603aab988
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_63BF9B0D_C271_4399_B567_890C007FD834"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫When I next woke up, I had been stripped bare and was surrounded by men I didn’t recognize. "
"⟪k:1⟫The words they spoke were gibberish to my ears."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Quand je me suis réveillé, on m’avait dépouillé et j’étais entouré d’hommes que je ne "
"reconnaissais pas. ⟪k:1⟫Les mots qu’ils employaient étaient du charabia à mes oreilles."

#: scenario8:scenario8_D06F54B4_185B_46AE_B6E6_F141A5CF6BAD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6f9ea9a11f52aac864c0c4dcde8247b50df9edc6ca55f284bcdb8dd80e7eb1a6
