msgid "⟪k:0⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫............"

#: scenario8:scenario8_AB108AB8_AA28_450D_AE9A_53D970552B95
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9953530a8bdcb2b66dcda7120bd51ab7386923f30f70a8e0b64b4ea5936fe978
#. default-sha256: c5ed274ed1393ab3ccec5040b22337036fa5bddea3eec4de7755670e58588a7d
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_AB108AB8_AA28_450D_AE9A_53D970552B95"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Over time, I came to learn their language—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫though I can only speak it; ⟪k:4⟫I "
"don’t know how to read or write."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Avec le temps, je finis par apprendre leur langue—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫mais je peux seulement la "
"parler ; ⟪k:4⟫je ne saurais ni la lire ni l’écrire."

#: scenario8:scenario8_5546A0EE_64F6_4344_B502_11EFE882CDB5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6601eccd8bedf69853b23b8989357f86b43c4c5501120d483ec132f10b902421
#. default-sha256: df7ff3f1214f920944da2ca780e9f213871b241b851b42115877531878ba0ab5
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_5546A0EE_64F6_4344_B502_11EFE882CDB5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫A darkness grew inside me with each repeated insult.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I wanted to make them pay for "
"the daily abuse."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Chacune de leurs insultes accroissait ma noirceur intérieure.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Je voulais leur faire "
"payer les violences quotidiennes qu’ils m’infligeaient."

#: scenario8:scenario8_32D303D1_C03A_4E23_8477_EDF7C7EF30C6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a24c43d10aa1059dcae6bbbf4b21969c74548ea8f7bc409cb8f0fb767409f0cf
#. default-sha256: 61b52d5a9acbcd6229961a8de3f961f7c093ec3a38480e4754fd3c53b1a7b26a
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_32D303D1_C03A_4E23_8477_EDF7C7EF30C6"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And who wouldn’t? The desire to exact vengeance when you’ve been mistreated is only natural. "
"It’s perfectly reasonable."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Et quoi de plus normal ? Le désir de se venger, quand on a été maltraité, est tout à fait "
"naturel. C’est parfaitement raisonnable."

#: scenario8:scenario8_ADF8CDC2_78C4_4165_9B48_6BFD50A39D0C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 01cf4711d557b66f1582fef9ca6369484995fd16917d79f7a608237709e7947e
#. default-sha256: aa47bd354bdbb3be9548bea91735429a94b9362601f2cafa6c991459f4fcc61d
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_ADF8CDC2_78C4_4165_9B48_6BFD50A39D0C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫They looked like me a year earlier: ⟪k:1⟫deprived of food and water and beaten into "
"submission."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ils me faisaient penser à moi un an plus tôt : ⟪k:1⟫ils étaient privés de nourriture, d’eau "
"et battus jusqu’à ce qu’ils ne puissent plus se relever."

#: scenario8:scenario8_835310F6_069D_4F34_A775_EF2F3EFBA66F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6abcb8b670a2b4418b6bbcf0d1ad3dd54bc5c117fbfe7b6ce6facf736781e3f4
#. default-sha256: d4d296c0cc9b529f777e81b1162379ddfc5da9469eaf6ffed36bbbb2d605854b
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_835310F6_069D_4F34_A775_EF2F3EFBA66F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Sitting beside me was a young girl, crying in silence."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Assise à côté de moi se trouvait une jeune fille, qui pleurait en silence."

#: scenario8:scenario8_E8E5AB87_D69C_4058_8B8F_F515CEB1EB83
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4fbcf52eb0ffabbc071fbe72a28eee93dbd1193548962694da760bb221dca7a1
#. default-sha256: ddb81356a56d86030b5b0c5dd096b3e90cc22f9358e3a5285b4d137c9702a3fb
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_E8E5AB87_D69C_4058_8B8F_F515CEB1EB83"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫perhaps because I had a similarly unusual appearance.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫What caught my attention, "
"though, was the way she was crying."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫...peut-être parce que moi aussi j’avais une apparence également inhabituelle.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Ce "
"qui attira mon attention, cependant, ce fut la manière dont elle pleurait."

#: scenario8:scenario8_EBD60DDB_4658_44B8_B36C_062F56D7DFCD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d4f54bf3b21bb41ea283a9081d8b7ee0b2e7f276691a4586c5880a0cd6db769e
#. default-sha256: 0e78f4b2c4eb00ba8d736379091b623ab6abb1afbe8c86bb9dd2698de5c770d6
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_EBD60DDB_4658_44B8_B36C_062F56D7DFCD"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫To this day, I still don’t understand."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Jusqu’à ce jour, je ne comprends toujours pas."

#: scenario8:scenario8_2B84FADB_83B3_45E7_A6EC_B74CE1F75E91
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6f22a71c39f156719c30eea9dbb8c573b282b184d7a8e9eaad3f06f2f9951468
#. default-sha256: abf856bf92790eaa2f4c1621ee89595f51fb43866612c45fa2c6d61ea2ead38d
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_2B84FADB_83B3_45E7_A6EC_B74CE1F75E91"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And so I took action, driven by that desire."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Et donc, je choisis d’agir, conduit par ce désir."

#: scenario8:scenario8_BB056D07_1356_41C0_84A8_F4DD8B0136A2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 36fe9644d15197630596fa1af9fc15baf07cdd928f943c1565fe8e5db41a881d
