msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Hih hih... ⟪k:1⟫hih hih hih...⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫hahahaha... ⟪k:4⟫AAAAAAAHAHAHAHA !"

#: scenario8:scenario8_DEC2EA83_12F0_4863_BF43_878D97A2F0EF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f8a9e26efcc4becb0e69c0ae6e50b3af0a09666037a420b9d2b4e9278a00a0ab
#. default-sha256: 250e97e420b399d7160d7b7eabe3b441038e58055b5af3661a66fb3d2c3594a0
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_DEC2EA83_12F0_4863_BF43_878D97A2F0EF"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I-⟪k:1⟫I have a wife... ⟪k:2⟫and children! Please!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫J-⟪k:1⟫J’ai une femme... ⟪k:2⟫et des enfants ! S’il vous plaît !"

#: scenario8:scenario8_298B5185_05D6_4808_99AD_A2B0277FD14E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: db8e4aaca8eaad832600c12d49666c33903fa330644c6dee7d77b8582ff2db00
#. default-sha256: 841350c579375cc5bd0f73c331551fcf38d7470e3d40186c31e9fc14f6813396
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_298B5185_05D6_4808_99AD_A2B0277FD14E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Even with the shackles still around my wrists, I had little trouble slaughtering the slave "
"traders and their guards."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Même avec les chaînes encore autour de mes poignets, je n’eus aucun mal à massacrer les "
"marchands d’esclaves ainsi que leurs gardes."

#: scenario8:scenario8_DDB36FD1_459A_41A4_BDCD_13E71889DFF8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 01f60538af06d7ebde9f64f2b96ab1ab34abb14de2afd6a3844466fdf30a332c
