msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫While I now understand her near-compulsive deeds of charity were⟪k:1⟫a result of the stress "
"and uncertainty she felt about herself, at the time,⟪k:2⟫I believed she was doing it because she "
"genuinely wanted to."
